  message: "Merged in PR #1606 (ee7dcb505c). After WI-himod migrated the resolver cohort, the static check left 14 analyzer branch-tier sites (the ~60 estimate counted the 29 linker sites and the resolver products). Dispositions: (a) resolution grade: llvm_ir (min of two grades), agda (resolver grade; the 0.80 body / 0.75 signature split ignored match quality), ruby cascade (route grades 1.0 / 0.90 / 0.85 x resolver; the old 0.90 was over the ast_call ceiling); (b)/(derive): imports and includes set is_resolved and derive the base instead of a lower literal (d_lang, puppet, scss, astro, svelte, vue); local-registry calls derive base/unresolved base (matlab, purescript, racket, scheme published 1.0 on ast_call_direct, over the ceiling; robot also relabelled static -> ast_call_direct); (c) caller-valued with '# ADR-0039 caller-valued:' marker: js_ts ast_call_namespace and R qualified_call (pending-classification placeholders, no band, cluster-D audit). Evidence: check-confidence-sites reports 0 computed_uncommented; affected analyzer tests updated to the derived values and pass (full smart-test 30420 passed + 9 updated)."  # f642
